  "notes": "## 0.14.0-alpha.5 - 2026-06-06\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a quick panel setting for opening at the screen center or near the cursor, and make filtering from the search bar easier to use by mouse or keyboard (#936)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent repeated image captures from creating duplicate history entries, repeated syncs, or unbounded cache growth (#959)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.14.0-alpha.5 - 2026-06-06\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增快捷面板展示位置设置，可选择在屏幕中央或鼠标附近打开，并让搜索栏筛选更适合鼠标和键盘操作 (#936)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复重复图片捕获可能造成剪贴板历史重复、反复同步或缓存持续增长的问题 (#959)",
